{'symbol': 'CTXS', 'date': '2022-01-04 15:45:00', 'title': 'THORNTON LAW FIRM REMINDS CITRIX SYSTEMS (CTXS) INVESTORS OF CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT', 'text': "BOSTON, MASSACHUSETTS--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JANUARY 4, 2022) - \xa0THE THORNTON LAW FIRM ALERTS INVESTORS THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. (NASDAQ: CTXS). THE CASE IS CURRENTLY IN THE LEAD PLAINTIFF STAGE. INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED CITRIX COMMON STOCK BETWEEN JANUARY 22, 2020 AND OCTOBER 6, 2021 MAY CONTACT THE THORNTON LAW FIRM'S INVESTOR PROTECTION TEAM BY VISITING WWW.TENLAW.COM/CASES/CITRIX FOR MORE INFORMATION. INVESTORS MAY ALSO EMAIL INVESTORS@TENLAW.COM..."}{'symbol': 'CTXS', 'date': '2022-01-04 13:30:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ACTION NOTICE: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS WITH LOSSES IN EXCESS OF $250,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JANUARY 4, 2022) - \xa0THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. ("CITRIX" OR "THE COMPANY") (NASDAQ: CTXS) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.'}